  "policy": "Positive density defines novel budget B=max(1,floor(N*density)); absolute combined ceiling C=min(N,max(1,floor(N*.75))). Zero density switches nothing. From eligible, nonoverlapping, complete units, reserve one fitting novel item in validated producer priority, select seen items due-first then source order, then add further novel items in producer priority within B and C. Render in source order. Seen means verified visible dwell, never mastery or semantic authorization. Never manufacture units or exceed bounds; cost is explicit. Selection snapshot stays stable for the presented message.",
  "schema": "vipi-additive-selection-cases-1",
  "scope": "Shared policy fixtures; budgets are explicitly supplied. Native source bounds, semantic eligibility and exposure state must be independently validated before this selector is called. These cases do not validate translations or actual visibility.",
